1
00:03:36,428 --> 00:03:42,428
Indoor cat. Outdoor adventure.

2
00:07:12,857 --> 00:07:18,857
The Garfield Movie is a family, comedy, adventure film directed by Mark Dindal.

3
00:10:49,285 --> 00:10:55,285
Garfield, the world-famous, Monday-hating, lasagna-loving indoor
cat, is about to have a wild outdoor adventure!

4
00:14:25,714 --> 00:14:31,714
After an unexpected reunion with his long-lost father – scruffy street cat Vic – Garfield and his canine friend Odie
are forced from their perfectly pampered life into joining Vic in a hilarious, high-stakes heist.

5
00:18:02,142 --> 00:18:08,142
Garfield (voice), played by Chris Pratt.

6
00:21:38,571 --> 00:21:44,571
Vic (voice), played by Samuel L. Jackson.

7
00:25:15,000 --> 00:25:21,000
Jinx (voice), played by Hannah Waddingham.

8
00:28:51,428 --> 00:28:57,428
Otto (voice), played by Ving Rhames.

9
00:32:27,857 --> 00:32:33,857
Jon (voice), played by Nicholas Hoult.

10
00:36:04,285 --> 00:36:10,285
Marge Malone (voice), played by Cecily Strong.

11
00:39:40,714 --> 00:39:46,714
The Garfield Movie is a 2024 American animated adventure comedy film
based on the comic strip Garfield created by Jim Davis.

12
00:43:17,142 --> 00:43:23,142
Directed by Mark Dindal and written by Paul A.

13
00:46:53,571 --> 00:46:59,571
Kaplan, Mark Torgove, and David Reynolds, it is the third
theatrical Garfield film adaptation and the sixth overall.

14
00:50:30,000 --> 00:50:36,000
The film features the voices of Chris Pratt as Garfield and Samuel L.

15
00:54:06,428 --> 00:54:12,428
Jackson as his father, alongside Hannah Waddingham, Ving Rhames, Nicholas Hoult, Cecily
Strong, Harvey Guillén, Brett Goldstein, Bowen Yang, and Snoop Dogg.

16
00:57:42,857 --> 00:57:48,857
In the film, Garfield is reunited with his long-lost father, a street cat named
Vic, before being forced into joining him on a high-stakes adventure.

17
01:01:19,285 --> 01:01:25,285
Development on The Garfield Movie began at Alcon Entertainment in 2016.

18
01:04:55,714 --> 01:05:01,714
Dindal was announced as the film's director in November 2018,
and pre-production began the following month.

19
01:08:32,142 --> 01:08:38,142
By 2021, Pratt had been cast as Garfield, with the rest
of the cast joining the following year.

20
01:12:08,571 --> 01:12:14,571
The film was animated by DNEG Animation, while John Debney, a
frequent collaborator of Dindal, composed the score.

21
01:15:45,000 --> 01:15:51,000
The Garfield Movie was released internationally on May
1, 2024, by Sony Pictures Releasing.

22
01:19:21,428 --> 01:19:27,428
In the United States, the film premiered at the Grauman's Chinese
Theatre in Los Angeles on May 19, and was released on May 24.

23
01:22:57,857 --> 01:23:03,857
The film received negative reviews from critics and was a box-office
success, grossing $257 million against a $60 million budget.

24
01:26:34,285 --> 01:26:40,285
It was nominated at the 2024 Kids' Choice Awards for Favorite Animated Movie.

25
01:30:10,714 --> 01:30:16,714
A sequel is in development.

26
01:33:47,142 --> 01:33:53,142
The film explores themes of friendship, cat, villain, based on comic, lasagna.

27
01:37:23,571 --> 01:37:29,571
The tone is lighthearted.
